@startuml
title Change Theme Sequence (Mobile local settings)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Change Theme UI" as ThemeUi
control "AppSettingsNotifier\n(FE Controller)" as SettingsController
control "LocalStorage\n(Device)" as LocalStorage

note over ThemeUi, LocalStorage
Checked in current code:
Theme is changed by AppSettingsNotifier.setThemeMode(themeMode).
The selected theme is saved to LocalStorage with StorageKeys.appTheme.
Allowed values are light, dark and system.
No FE DTO, BE DTO, API controller, repository, DbContext or database is used.
end note

Learner -> ThemeUi: Select theme
ThemeUi -> SettingsController: setThemeMode(themeMode)
SettingsController -> SettingsController: Map ThemeMode to value
SettingsController -> LocalStorage: Save StorageKeys.appTheme
LocalStorage --> SettingsController: Saved theme value
SettingsController -> SettingsController: Update AppSettingsState.themeMode
SettingsController --> ThemeUi: Rebuild themed UI

@enduml
